PnL with historical movements of indices like finnifty, nifty, sensex, midcapnifty, bankex, and banknifty."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{children:"Social Sharing: Share your trading journey on Twitter and engage with the community "})]})},{question:"Do I need to be an algo trader or an AlgoTest user to use this feature?",answer:"No, you do not need to be an algo trader or an AlgoTest user to benefit from Daily Trades Analysis. This feature is designed for all types of traders."},{question:"How do I use Daily Trades Analysis?",answer:"Simply upload your trade files to our platform, and the tool will automatically generate the MTM graph and detailed breakdowns of your trades and brokerage fees."},{question:"Can I see how my PnL correlates with historical index movements?",answer:"Yes, you can select the historical price movements of various indices (finnifty, nifty, sensex, midcapnifty, bankex, banknifty) to see how your PnL might be correlated with market trends."},{question:"How can I share my trading journey?",answer:"You can easily share your MTM graph and trade analysis on Twitter, allowing you to connect and engage with your trading community."},{question:"What type of traders can benefit from Daily Trades Analysis?",answer:"Daily Trades Analysis is beneficial for all traders, including trend followers and option sellers, helping them refine and improve their trading strategies."},{question:"How do I get started with Daily Trades Analysis?",answer:"Visit our platform, upload your trade files, and start analyzing your trades with the MTM graph and detailed breakdowns. It’s simple and quick to get started!"}]},97170:(e,t,r)=>{"use strict";r.d(t,{HV:()=>d,Ll:()=>l,Np:()=>a,ZT:()=>o,fA:()=>n,tj:()=>c,wd:()=>i});let a={TRADE_ID:"Trade #",TYPE:"Type",SIGNAL:"Signal",DATE_TIME:"Date and time",PRICE_INR:"Price INR"},s={ENTRY_LONG:"entry long",EXIT_LONG:"exit long",ENTRY_SHORT:"entry short",EXIT_SHORT:"exit short"},l={Long:"Long",Short:"Short"},n={Long:[s.ENTRY_LONG,s.EXIT_LONG],Sh